<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <title>Acesso administrativo · Rosemary CMS</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <%= csrf_meta_tags %><%= csp_meta_tag %>
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag "application", "data-turbo-track": "reload" %>
    <%= javascript_importmap_tags %>
  </head>
  <body class="auth-page">
    <main class="auth-shell">
      <aside class="auth-intro">
        <%= link_to "R", root_path, class: "auth-brand", aria: { label: "Voltar ao site" } %>
        <span class="auth-eyebrow">Rosemary CMS</span>
        <h1>Seu espaço<br>para cuidar<br>do conteúdo.</h1>
        <p>Organize páginas, atualize imagens e acompanhe os contatos em um só lugar.</p>
        <%= link_to "← Voltar ao site", root_path, class: "auth-back" %>
      </aside>
      <section class="auth-panel">
        <% if notice.present? %><p class="auth-feedback" role="status"><%= notice %></p><% end %>
        <% if alert.present? %><p class="auth-feedback auth-feedback--error" role="alert"><%= alert %></p><% end %>
        <%= yield %>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
